<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower. Trading was moderate. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    53.50-54.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $0.50. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-500 lbs   45.00-47.25,</p>
<p>		   those at 47.25 400-500 lbs selected</p>
<p>		   500-650 lbs   50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
